  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "A small particle moves to position <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> from its initial position <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> under the action of force <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>. The value of work done will be ______&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "40",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Work done by a constant force is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Force</mi><mfenced><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>Displacement</mi><mfenced><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></math>, where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p>Given here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p>",
